lRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-07T16:18:53","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"b7d4c3d5-410b-4d2c-be39-f47aeba9d0ab","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230938362,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"AI短剧制片实习生(J11122)","OrgId":2903505,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 协助制片完成AI短剧项目全流程辅助工作，跟进项目筹备、内容梳理、进度对接等基础事务；\n2. 完成制片安排的其他日常项目辅助、文件整理、信息对接等工作。","Require":"1. 对短剧/海外短剧赛道有浓厚兴趣，关注行业动态，愿意深耕AI短剧方向；\n2. 热爱欧美文化，熟悉欧美影视、文学、音乐等内容风格与题材特点；\n3. 英语阅读、听力能力过关，可独立阅读英文剧本；\n4. 影视、动画相关专业背景优先，了解分镜、故事板、镜头语言、画面构图基础知识者加分；\n5. 做事细心踏实、责任心强、执行力好，沟通协作顺畅，能保证稳定在岗实习。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-07T15:08:19","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"0ebb06a9-373c-4055-8321-9fba7a9b4c75","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230933684,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"AI短剧导演(J11115)","OrgId":3180968,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、根据策划案和剧本的市场/内容语境，制定本地化的视觉方向，包括人物形象、场景、服装、镜头语言和整体风格。\n2、参与剧本评审，从节奏、可视化效果、制作可行性及前10集吸引力等角度提出专业意见。\n3、将剧本转化为可执行的分镜和制作方案，明确关键表演、镜头重点、视觉钩子及质量要求。\n4、指导AI制作师完成角色资产、场景资产、分镜和视频生成，对关键镜头或高难度镜头进行示范和直接处理。\n5、负责制作过程中的日常成片审核，识别人物一致性、动作、表演、景别、构图、节奏、音画关系等问题并输出明确、可执行的修改意见，协调AI制作师完成返工，并跟踪修改结果。\n6、与剪辑师协作，把控成片节奏、情绪、配音、音乐、音效和字幕效果。\n复盘项目中的典型问题和优秀案例，协助沉淀视觉规范、镜头模板、角色一致性标准及制作方法。","Require":"1、有2年以上真人短剧、影视、广告或AI叙事视频相关导演经验。\n2、有女性向、男性向或强情节商业内容经验；必须拥有至少1部已经正式上线的真人短剧或AI短剧爆款作品。\n3、具备完整的叙事和导演能力，能够独立完成短剧项目的视觉方案、角色和场景设定、分镜拆解及关键镜头制作。\n4、熟练使用主流AI图像、视频、文本和音频工具，能够快速掌握公司内部自动化工作流。\n5、具备较强的质量判断和问题诊断能力，能够给出清晰、具体、可落地的返工意见。\n6、能够理解英文剧本，并对英文配音、字幕及海外语境下的人物表达作出基本判断。\n7、适应快速迭代、多个项目并行和AI工具持续变化的工作环境。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-26T15:32:28","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{